D2L MCP
=======

This project is a native Go MCP adaptation of d2l-cli v0.2.2:

  d2l-cli
  Copyright (c) 2026 Aaryan Kapoor
  https://github.com/Aaryan-Kapoor/d2l-cli
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The Brightspace endpoint selection, course-resolution priority, browser token
capture flow, SimpleSyllabus matching, content traversal, assignment matching,
snapshot behavior, and bundled agent guidance were derived from or designed
for behavioral compatibility with that project.

